00:04:11.596 --> 00:04:17.636
are not heads. More money behind a view pulls harder. 60 cents in that narrow case is a

00:04:17.636 --> 00:04:22.256
money weighted balance, and reading it as 60% is a reading of the balance, not a show

00:04:22.256 --> 00:04:27.936
of hands. Those assumptions do the work, and they often fail. A risk averse trader will

00:04:27.936 --> 00:04:32.456
not stake enough to drag the price all the way to their own chance, because being wrong

00:04:32.456 --> 00:04:37.456
hurts more than the expected gain feels worth, so the print can sit away from the average

00:04:37.456 --> 00:04:43.036
